<deviceset name="WE-SPXO_IQXO-540" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:14284058/4" prefix="Y" library_version="5">
<description>&lt;b&gt;WE-SPXO Simple Packaged Quartz Oscillator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Characteristics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt; SMT models
&lt;br&gt; Hermetically sealed
&lt;br&gt; Frequencies between 3.6864 MHz and 125 MHz
&lt;br&gt; Maximum operating temperatures range:-40 °C to 85 °C
&lt;br&gt; Stabilities down to ± 25 ppm available
&lt;br&gt; Available supply voltages: 1.8 V, 3.3 V and 5 V
&lt;br&gt; Available output signal types: CMOS; HCMOS; HCMOS/TTL
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Applications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt; Microprocessor
&lt;br&gt; Wireless Communication Devices
&lt;br&gt; Industrial Devices
&lt;br&gt; Real Time Clocks
&lt;br&gt; Wired Communication (e.g. Ethernet and USB)
&lt;br&gt; IoT
&lt;br&gt; Optical Network
&lt;br&gt; Audio and Multimedia Devices
&lt;br&gt; Test and Measurement Equipment
&lt;br&gt; Navigation and Locators
&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.we-online.com/catalog/media/o135918v209%20Family_WE-SPXO.jpg" title="Enlarge picture"&gt;
&lt;img src="https://www.we-online.com/catalog/media/o135918v209%20Family_WE-SPXO.jpg" width="320"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Details see: &lt;a href="https://www.we-online.com/catalog/en/WE-SPXO"&gt;https://www.we-online.com/catalog/en/WE-SPXO&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;Updated by Ella Wu, 2019-09-03 &lt;br&gt;
2019 (C) Wurth Elektronik</description>
